<title>BELGIUM: Belgium sets publication dates for 1997 CPI data.</title>
<headline>Belgium sets publication dates for 1997 CPI data.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian economics ministry on Friday gave the following provisional calendar for the publication of its consumer price data in 1997:</p>
<p>    January 29		July 29</p>
<p>    February 27	     August 28</p>
<p>    March 27		  September 29</p>
<p>    April 29		  October 29</p>
<p>    May 29		    November 27</p>
<p>    June 27		   December 29</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
